      "parent_id": 5.532433358683136e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553351527839305728",
      "text": "@Jan_208 @MrJamesPSmith @dennisgoodwin79 @stephenfry @elvis717 And that's putting it politely.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 00:44:19 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5333967687111066e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553229080406290432",
      "text": "@steviep56 I was referring less to the article and more to him using his influence to support actions that probably created ISIS.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 16:37:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532284277222277e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553324057907957760",
      "text": "@dennisgoodwin79 @stephenfry @L6HJH @elvis717 is this trolling or are you just a complete shit?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 22:55:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531864953483469e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553240657402527744",
      "text": "@steviep56 I'd accept the 'wisdom gone astray' line, if he hadn't been so blatant about the oil thing. When did he get like that?!",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 17:23:46 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532399883062026e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553239988306202624",
      "text": "@davegantly yep, but 'told you so' only looks wise after the fact. Many prophets go very quiet after. So before an act=intelligent belief.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 17:21:06 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5323446422326886e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553231264527163393",
      "text": "@davegantly as for ISIS, surely his point is that whatever the effect of Iraq war or any other it should never be that mediaeval barbarity?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 16:46:26 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532290804062904e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553228427722227712",
      "text": "@davegantly just thought the article made an argument and you're point ignored that and attacked the man. One doesn't to the other?",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 16:35:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532277284604682e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553233240249892864",
      "text": "@steviep56 But it did lead to medieval barbarity. He supported it, and that's what happened. They were 100% wrong, him too.",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 16:54:17 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.532312645271634e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553187658059747328",
      "text": "@stephenfry @elvis717 This blog is a good read too. Along the same lines, different tone. http://t.co/J2M3TlhEbI",
      "timestamp": "Thu Jan 08 13:53:10 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.531854046573527e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553240476347023360",
      "text": "@davegantly and surely the point is it didn't lead inexorably to barbarity that's just the path the loons took.",
